Omission
- [N1] Omitted trace (input 1): i1:To start the process, begin by supplying the requirement and then documenting it. -> i2:If the order is received via fax -> i3:input the order into an Excel file -> i6:Once the Excel list is complete after a week, send it to the student. -> i7:Upon receiving the Excel list, type the orders into the MS-Access database. -> i8:ensure that it is completed -> i9:Once the database is completed, control the incoming order. -> i10:At the same time, continue to do the check. -> i11:If the order is correct, release it. -> i12:Send the Excel list to the student and upon receiving it, continue with the process. -> i15:If the order is worth more than 5.000 €, send it for sign off and continue with the check. -> i17:Once the order is signed off, contact the client and release the order. -> i18:Once the order is received by PPC, they will initiate production. -> i19:If the issue cannot be solved, cancel the order. -> i22:If the order needs to be cancelled, the process ends.
